Drafts live here — files with no date in the filename are not built into the site.

They are NOT private. In a public repository anyone can read this folder on
GitHub, and search engines index repository files. "Not published" means "not on
your site", not "not visible". Never put anything here you would mind being read.

For a post that exists but should not be live yet, `published: false` in its
front matter is the better tool — it keeps the post off the site, the feed and
the sitemap while the file stays where the rest of your posts are.
